# The library stylesheets are copied verbatim from spec/components/bundle.css
# and tokens.css has to stay byte identical to spec/tokens.css. Prettier keeps
# every selector and declaration intact here, but it rewrites the quotes of
# attribute selectors and content strings ("page" to 'page'), which would break
# a plain diff against the reference. So the whole folder stays unformatted.
